{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44994","headline":"劳山忆栖霞寺道素上人久期不至 · 皎然","name":"劳山忆栖霞寺道素上人久期不至","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远寺萧萧独坐心，山情自得趣何深。\n泉声稍滴芙蓉漏，月影才分鹦鹉林。\n满地云轻长碍屣，绕松风近每吹襟。\n贪闲不记前心偈，念别聊爲出世吟。\n更待花开徧山雪，山山相似若爲寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44994.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44994","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}